    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Data Analysis of Suicide in Nigeria\"\nauthor: \"Gift David\"\nformat:\n  dashboard:\n    logo: dashboard/assets/images/thcai-logo.png\n    nav-buttons:\n      - icon: file\n        title: report\n        href: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15hE46jFvj5pnw4lbcJsg3NOOu0spqng-XktD4CuAUO4/edit?usp=sharing\nserver: \n  shiny: true\n  engine: knitr \nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n  output: true\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n# Overview\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n## Row\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"card bslib-card bslib-mb-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container bslib-value-box default\" color=\"#F5F5F5\" data-bslib-card-init data-require-bs-caller=\"card() value_box()\" data-require-bs-version=\"5 5\" icon=\"gender-male\">\n<div class=\"card-body bslib-gap-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container\" style=\"margin-top:auto;margin-bottom:auto;flex:1 1 auto;\">\n<div class=\"value-box-area html-fill-item html-fill-container\">\n<p class=\"value-box-title\">Male suicide rate per 100,000 from 2000–2019</p>\n<p class=\"value-box-value\">6.2%</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script data-bslib-card-init>bslib.Card.initializeAllCards();</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"card bslib-card bslib-mb-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container bslib-value-box default\" color=\"#FFA725\" data-bslib-card-init data-require-bs-caller=\"card() value_box()\" data-require-bs-version=\"5 5\" icon=\"gender-female\">\n<div class=\"card-body bslib-gap-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container\" style=\"margin-top:auto;margin-bottom:auto;flex:1 1 auto;\">\n<div class=\"value-box-area html-fill-item html-fill-container\">\n<p class=\"value-box-title\">Female suicide rate per 100,000 from 2000–2019</p>\n<p class=\"value-box-value\">2.4%</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script data-bslib-card-init>bslib.Card.initializeAllCards();</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"card bslib-card bslib-mb-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container bslib-value-box default\" color=\"#F5F5F5\" data-bslib-card-init data-require-bs-caller=\"card() value_box()\" data-require-bs-version=\"5 5\" icon=\"people\">\n<div class=\"card-body bslib-gap-spacing html-fill-item html-fill-container\" style=\"margin-top:auto;margin-bottom:auto;flex:1 1 auto;\">\n<div class=\"value-box-area html-fill-item html-fill-container\">\n<p class=\"value-box-title\">Average suicide rate from 2000 to 2019</p>\n<p class=\"value-box-value\">4.3%</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script data-bslib-card-init>bslib.Card.initializeAllCards();</script>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n## Row {font-size = 1px}\n\n### Column {.tabset}\n## Yearly Average Suicide Rate\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n## By Age Group\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n## By Age and Gender (3D)\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n### Column {.tabset}\n\n## Summary of Suicide Rates by Gender\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-4d7f52a4e982085d0584\" style=\"width:100%;height:406px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4d7f52a4e982085d0584\">{\"x\":{\"visdat\":{\"81cd72c0cffb\":[\"function () \",\"plotlyVisDat\"]},\"cur_data\":\"81cd72c0cffb\",\"attrs\":{\"81cd72c0cffb\":{\"x\":{},\"y\":{},\"color\":{},\"colors\":[\"#00809D\",\"#328E6E\"],\"alpha_stroke\":1,\"sizes\":[10,100],\"spans\":[1,20],\"type\":\"bar\"}},\"layout\":{\"margin\":{\"b\":40,\"l\":60,\"t\":25,\"r\":10},\"title\":\"Total Suicide Rates by Gender\",\"xaxis\":{\"domain\":[0,1],\"automargin\":true,\"title\":\"Gender\",\"type\":\"category\",\"categoryorder\":\"array\",\"categoryarray\":[\"FEMALE\",\"MALE\"]},\"yaxis\":{\"domain\":[0,1],\"automargin\":true,\"title\":\"Suicide Rate\"},\"hovermode\":\"closest\",\"showlegend\":true},\"source\":\"A\",\"config\":{\"modeBarButtonsToAdd\":[\"hoverclosest\",\"hovercompare\"],\"showSendToCloud\":false},\"data\":[{\"x\":[\"FEMALE\"],\"y\":[208.64000000000001],\"type\":\"bar\",\"name\":\"FEMALE\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"rgba(50,142,110,1)\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"rgba(50,142,110,1)\"}},\"textfont\":{\"color\":\"rgba(50,142,110,1)\"},\"error_y\":{\"color\":\"rgba(50,142,110,1)\"},\"error_x\":{\"color\":\"rgba(50,142,110,1)\"},\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"frame\":null},{\"x\":[\"MALE\"],\"y\":[628.15999999999997],\"type\":\"bar\",\"name\":\"MALE\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,128,157,1)\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,128,157,1)\"}},\"textfont\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,128,157,1)\"},\"error_y\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,128,157,1)\"},\"error_x\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,128,157,1)\"},\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"frame\":null}],\"highlight\":{\"on\":\"plotly_click\",\"persistent\":false,\"dynamic\":false,\"selectize\":false,\"opacityDim\":0.20000000000000001,\"selected\":{\"opacity\":1},\"debounce\":0},\"shinyEvents\":[\"plotly_hover\",\"plotly_click\",\"plotly_selected\",\"plotly_relayout\",\"plotly_brushed\",\"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n## Suicide Mortality Trends in Nigeria (2000–2017)\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](index_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-19-1.png){width=768}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\nQuarto enables you to weave together content and executable code into a finished document. To learn more about Quarto see <https://quarto.org>.\n",
